classes A, B, C, D;

// Normalizes to wfq[(A,1), (D,3), (rr[B,C],2)] (WFQ sorts by arm content,
// and FIFO < RR). Paired with [wfq_Y_rrBC_diff], whose arms are not an
// in-order subsequence of these, so the comparator reaches the label
// walk: A and D are unmatched and retire, Y is fresh, and the RR arm is
// matched with only its weight changed.
policy = wfq[(A, 1), (D, 3), (rr[B, C], 2)];

return policy
